{"src":"en","tgt":"es","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"es","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5812.560576,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6124.03743,"text":"Los leones son los felinos más sociales que viven en grupos grandes llamados manadas."},{"kind":"audio","t":6181.403954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6185.892351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6191.107627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6193.860549,"samples":24096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":11426.574162,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11720.613191,"text":"En el clima cálido del Medio Oriente, la casa no era tan importante."},{"kind":"audio","t":11778.568586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11781.219169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11781.86217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":11782.232945,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17724.089904,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18064.837187,"text":"Casi todas son playas de arena con natación segura y la mayoría tienen sombra proporcionada por"},{"kind":"audio","t":18112.616136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18117.597306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18122.774103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18128.013049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":18128.257106,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":20579.146152,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20735.080401,"text":"árboles de pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20784.547796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":20784.863022,"samples":2032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26120.217223,"text":"Brides are made up of 1 to 3 related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26507.216426,"text":"Las novias están compuestas por 1 a 3 machos adultos emparentados junto con nosotros."},{"kind":"audio","t":26553.454926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26558.344047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26563.715182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26568.992778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26569.419472,"samples":8728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":32656.523471,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33063.452373,"text":"Los niños ferales pueden haber sufrido abusos infantiles graves o traumas antes de ser abandonados o huir."},{"kind":"audio","t":33122.75678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":33128.026226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33133.203513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":33138.584238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33142.463073,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":38533.62083,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 travels regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":38932.579795,"text":"El autobús 403 de Scottport viaja regularmente a Centra haciendo parada en Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":38989.750262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38994.712742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39000.071307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39005.276313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39007.108188,"samples":18328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":45861.412898,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46353.967648,"text":"Para obtener las mejores vistas de Hong Kong, salga de la isla y diríjase al paseo marítimo de Kowloon, justo enfrente."},{"kind":"audio","t":46413.455952000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46418.620869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46424.089803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46429.407118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46434.141391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":46434.388128,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51220.805101,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51604.305933,"text":"Se aceptaban las opiniones de Aristóteles en todas las cuestiones científicas, incluida la fisiología."},{"kind":"audio","t":51663.359993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51668.414722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51673.746687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":51679.024163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51680.64578,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":61157.567264,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor"},{"kind":"text","t":61586.259131,"text":"El australiano Mitchell Gowrie terminó en el puesto 11 en el Super G masculino, competidor de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":61638.472997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":61643.756643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61649.189397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61654.479153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61654.821018,"samples":8128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":67028.561909,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67391.582589,"text":"Ulrich Joklin terminó en el puesto 16 en el Super G masculino de sentados."},{"kind":"audio","t":67447.243767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67452.246686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67457.528802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67459.990928,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":73780.415259,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74240.84328,"text":"La ciudad contrasta fuertemente con el resto de las ciudades del país porque tiene más un aire árabe que un aire árabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":74299.21649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74304.547065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74309.934719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":74315.239655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74319.406116,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":84762.115171,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85336.069907,"text":"Además, tras la revolución, los puestos estuvieron abiertos a todos los solicitantes varones, permitiendo que los más ambiciosos y exitosos triunfaran."},{"kind":"audio","t":85403.619968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85408.549239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":85413.848935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85419.282858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85424.421816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85429.728221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85432.467973,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":91863.785496,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92342.987053,"text":"La bomba de fisión funciona bajo el principio de que se requiere energía para ensamblar un núcleo con muchos protones y neutrones."},{"kind":"audio","t":92404.039336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92409.41866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92414.835124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":92420.167759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":92425.608413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":92426.589909,"samples":13160,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":97450.099121,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97882.520025,"text":"No estableció una cifra para los recortes, afirmando que se realizarán basándose en la producción económica de China."},{"kind":"audio","t":97933.677817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97938.696686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":97944.1389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97949.540404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97954.81046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":97955.063356,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105770.816119,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106147.733543,"text":"No existe una definición universal de qué artículos manufacturados son antigüedades. Algunas agencias tributarias definen los bienes con más de 100 años."},{"kind":"audio","t":106206.113963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106211.32268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106216.510777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106220.001278,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":106273.631824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106278.680283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106283.93077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106284.283125,"samples":7296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":113930.755755,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114251.495539,"text":"En el archipiélago y los lagos no necesitas necesariamente un yate."},{"kind":"audio","t":114317.199895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114322.340323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114327.691558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":114328.072073,"samples":8496,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":123578.020475,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124229.347084,"text":"La relación de aspecto de este formato, dividiendo por 12 para obtener la relación de números enteros más simple, se dice por lo tanto que es de 3 a 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124292.582366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124297.630535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124302.93614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124308.207426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124313.260095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":124318.545491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124321.805035,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":131847.264186,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132330.74986299998,"text":"Es reconocida por ser un epicentro del lujo que comenzó alrededor del año 400 d.C. y duró hasta u"},{"kind":"audio","t":132390.70619099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132395.73158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132401.25410299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132406.161184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":132409.06024299999,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":136089.005802,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136348.13821099998,"text":"hasta aproximadamente el año 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"audio","t":136397.23290099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136398.457114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136398.76554999998,"samples":7064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":145383.166993,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146080.412247,"text":"Las políticas de cancelación varían, pero a finales de marzo la mayoría de las políticas de cancelación basadas en el coronavirus no se extienden hasta julio de 2020, cuando los Juegos Olímpicos"},{"kind":"audio","t":146154.106852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146159.17607999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146164.38075699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146169.710802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146174.901119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146180.20629499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146185.482001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146188.75058499997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146189.66092199998,"samples":18056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":154645.68823899998,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155141.03323899998,"text":"Mezcle los dos polvos secos y luego, con las manos limpias y húmedas, presiónelos hasta formar una bola."},{"kind":"audio","t":155189.68740599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155194.649526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155200.08133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":155205.153498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155207.103011,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":162240.16924,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162535.232604,"text":"Los cruceros a San Petersburgo incluyen tiempo en la ciudad. Los pasajeros de cruceros están exentos de los requisitos de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":162589.40984299997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162594.41559299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162598.13652,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":162661.11607599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162666.37055199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162671.747866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162671.98490299998,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173405.25729399998,"code":1005}]}